WEBVTT

00:01:00.223 --> 00:01:02.683
And that's, of course,
very important for us

00:01:02.683 --> 00:01:06.354
because we are all facing
the climate calamity

00:01:06.354 --> 00:01:09.607
and we are all talking
about how to grab carbon dioxide

00:01:09.607 --> 00:01:11.442
from the atmosphere.

00:01:11.442 --> 00:01:14.195
Well, it turns out that the whales

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:17.240
grab so much carbon dioxide
from the atmosphere --

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.076
by the way, they eat and they poop.

00:01:21.119 --> 00:01:22.453
Yeah. It's all about food.

00:01:24.831 --> 00:01:27.750
So how does the whale system work?

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:30.044
Well, it starts in the oceans.